From 4112662014e097eafb3dd6ba3446b7d1538640c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:25:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(build): a headless binary per crate

geometry, cl, tools, sim and motion each ship a small CLI in
src/bin/<package>.rs, shaped like post (USAGE, --help, --version,
bad input -> message + exit 1, no panic):

- camcraft-geometry: STL (binary/ASCII) -> triangles, bounds, open edges
- camcraft-cl: CL dump -> move stats, lengths, bounds, chaining
- camcraft-tools: list the catalog; speeds/feeds from the cutting table
- camcraft-sim: dexel cut of a stock box, removed volume, rapid/depth
  verdict (exit 2 when flagged)
- camcraft-motion: facing over a rectangle, written as a CL dump

cl gains cl::text, the golden CL dump reader/writer (byte-identical to
the app's golden writer; every golden round-trips). Each crate carries
tests/headless_bin.rs (happy path + bad input). Not packaged in the
release zip - see docs/decisions/32-headless-bins.md.

Fixes #32

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
